<mxCell id="p0-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="An admin opens the console. admin-bff starts the login, Azure AD runs the MFA, and Admin &amp; Partner swaps the code, saves the session, and signs a short admin JWT. No Kafka.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
