<mxCell id="p1-v27" parent="p1-v26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc Refresh(RefreshRequest) returns (TokenPair);&lt;br&gt;rpc Revoke(RevokeRequest)   returns (Empty);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message RefreshRequest { string refresh_token = 1; }&lt;br&gt;message RevokeRequest  { string session_id    = 1; }&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Valkey&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;family:{family_id} → { current_hash, session_id,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;principal_id }   TTL 12 h&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;refresh:{hash}     → family_id, used" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v28" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v29" parent="p1-v28" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="Valkey on refresh&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;current_hash = new hash&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;old hash marked used&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;On reuse or revoke&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;DEL family:{id}&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;admin_sessions.revoked_at · version&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;audit_log" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v30" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v31" parent="p1-v30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Rotation is one Valkey script (check used, mark used, set new) so two tabs cannot both win.&lt;br&gt;• Losing Valkey logs admins out; it never loses state that matters (§6)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v33" parent="p1-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• No denylist projector: a revoked session lasts until its access token expires, up to 5 minutes (§8).&lt;br&gt;• roles[] is re-read at refresh, which is how a grant change reaches the token (LLD 4).&lt;br&gt;• The 12 h family TTL is a draft value.&lt;br&gt;• This family is the admin session. A partner token has no refresh (LLD 3)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
