<mxCell id="p2-v33" parent="p2-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• §8: partners use client_credentials with private_key_jwt. No long-lived API key.&lt;br&gt;• partner-es512 is a different key from the admin key.&lt;br&gt;• Rotate or suspend is an admin gRPC on the client row; the next token request fails.&lt;br&gt;• O-09: which partners use partner-bff tokens is open.&lt;br&gt;• No refresh token. The client asks again with a new assertion." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
