<mxCell id="p3-v19" parent="p3-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#EAB308;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;Urgent removal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;also Revoke the session&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;kills the family (LLD 2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;access dies ≤ 5 min&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="172" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-e20" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3-v12" target="p3-v19" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#854D0E;fontColor=#854D0E;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="option"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v21" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v22" parent="p3-v21" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc AssignGrant(GrantRequest) returns (Grant);&lt;br&gt;rpc RevokeGrant(GrantRequest) returns (Empty);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message GrantRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string principal_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string brand_id     = 2;   // or * for platform&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string role         = 3;   // store-manager&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;// manage-menu · refund …&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string store_id     = 4;   // optional scope&lt;br&gt;}" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v24" parent="p3-v23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="admin_grants&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;principal_id · brand_id · role · store_id&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;granted_by · granted_at · revoked_at · version&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;audit_log: same transaction" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v26" parent="p3-v25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Assign is an upsert on (principal, brand, role, store), so a repeat is harmless." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v28" parent="p3-v27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• No topic: a grant on the bus would be a security event with no consumer that cannot read Postgres.&lt;br&gt;• admin-bff checks the grant from X-Roles; domains trust the headers.&lt;br&gt;• No fraud worker: a grant spike is an audit query.&lt;br&gt;• Role names are draft." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="5 · Register, rotate, or suspend" id="lld-4"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="p4-v1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;" value="Admin &amp; Partner LLD 5 — Register, rotate, or suspend a partner client" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="12" width="1920" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="An admin registers a partner client, uploads a new public key, or suspends the client. The write is gRPC and audited. The next token request uses the current key, or fails if the client is suspended.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#C2410C;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;" value="gRPC  ·  sync, the caller waits" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="86" width="360" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#2563EB;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;" value="HTTP  ·  edge or third party" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="86" width="360" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#5B21B6;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;" value="Kafka command  ·  &lt;domain&gt;.requested" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="776" y="86" width="360" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#047857;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;" value="Kafka fact  ·  after the commit" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1152" y="86" width="360" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B91C1C;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;" value="Failure exit  ·  status or DLQ" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1528" y="86" width="360" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v8" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeColor=#EAB308;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Flow  ·  gRPC RegisterClient / RotateClientKey / SuspendClient from admin-bff · caller waits" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="128" width="1948" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v9" parent="p4-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · admin-bff&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C2410C&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;RegisterClient&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C2410C&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;RotateClientKey · SuspendClient&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C2410C&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;manage-partner grant&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="48" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v10" parent="p4-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#EAB308;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · Partner clients&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;JWK valid · EC P-521&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;brand in caller scope&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="48" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-e11" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4-v9" target="p4-v10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#EA580C;fontColor=#EA580C;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="gRPC"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v12" parent="p4-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=62;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;3 · Aurora · commit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;client row · key_id&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;old key until grace ends&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;audit_log&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="48" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v13" parent="p4-v12" style="shape=image;html=1;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;selectable=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="27" width="30" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-e14" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4-v10" target="p4-v12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#64748B;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="commit"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v15" parent="p4-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · admin-bff&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C2410C&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;client · key_id&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="808" y="48" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-e16" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4-v12" target="p4-v15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#EA580C;fontColor=#EA580C;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="return"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v17" parent="p4-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;rejected&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;bad JWK → INVALID_ARGUMENT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;other brand → DENIED&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="172" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-e18" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4-v10" target="p4-v17" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DC2626;fontColor=#DC2626;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v19" parent="p4-v8" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#EAB308;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;Next token request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;LLD 3 uses the new key&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#854D0E&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;suspended → invalid_client&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="172" width="216" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-e20" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4-v12" target="p4-v19" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#854D0E;fontColor=#854D0E;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value="effect"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v21" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v22" parent="p4-v21" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc RegisterClient(RegisterClientRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (PartnerClient);&lt;br&gt;rpc RotateClientKey(RotateClientKeyRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (PartnerClient);&lt;br&gt;rpc SuspendClient(SuspendClientRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (PartnerClient);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message RotateClientKeyRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string client_id  = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string public_jwk = 2;     // EC, ES512&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int32  grace_hours = 3;    // old key still valid (draft)&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message SuspendClientRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string client_id = 1; string reason = 2;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message RegisterClientRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string client_id = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;repeated string brand_ids = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string scopes = 3;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string public_jwk = 4;  // EC, ES512&lt;br&gt;}" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v24" parent="p4-v23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="partner_client_keys&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;client_id · key_id · public_jwk&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;valid_from · valid_until&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;partner_clients&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status (active | suspended) · version&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;audit_log: same transaction" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v26" parent="p4-v25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A repeat rotate with the same JWK finds the same key_id and returns it.&lt;br&gt;• Partner tokens live 5 minutes, so a suspend takes full effect within 5 minutes." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v27" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v28" parent="p4-v27" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• We store the public key only, never a long-lived API key (§8).&lt;br&gt;• No topic: a rotate on the bus would be a security event with no consumer.&lt;br&gt;• Grace period is a draft value, to agree with partners.&lt;br&gt;• Register is the same write: one client row, one public key, one audit row." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>